#. Tag: title
#: templatecreation.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating Templates, Saving a document as a template and Deleting Templates"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; comes with several predefined templates (both Page Layout and Text "
"Oriented templates), which are designed to provide initial formatting of "
"documents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, however, the same format for a custom document is used over and over, "
"&kword; can create a template which more exactly matches the needs of the "
"document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An unlimited number of templates can be created in &kword;, and they can be "
"organized into categories for easy recall."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: templatecreation.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new template"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: templatecreation.docbook:25 templatecreation.docbook:78
#: templatecreation.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "templates"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: templatecreation.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "creating"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Templates are created by first generating the layout in &kword; based on one "
"of the predefined templates, and then saving the file. Instead of saving it "
"as a traditional file, it is saved as a template."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What follows, is a step by step process to save the current document as a "
"template."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the document is a completed template, Select <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create Template From Document...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "This brings up a dialog:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "This dialog helps organize the templates into groups (categories)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the group to place the new template into."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new group to place templates in, simply click the button labeled "
"<guibutton>Add Group</guibutton>. A dialog box will appear asking for the "
"name of the new group. Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> and the new group is "
"created."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type in a name for the template in the text box labeled <guilabel>Name</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the icon for your new template by using the radio buttons on the right"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword; has a default icon, which is shown below both options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the icon, select <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> and a dialog box will "
"appear. Simply select the desired icon using the dialog box. Click "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> when the icon is selected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr "Clicatz sus <guibutton>Validar</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have saved the template, the next time you open a document, your "
"new category/new template will appear in the open file dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: templatecreation.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a template"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: templatecreation.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "deleting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "To delete a template, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:82 templatecreation.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create Template From "
"Document...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:85 templatecreation.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "This will bring up a dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the small plus sign (+) in front of the template group where the "
"template can be found."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click once on the template name"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:90 templatecreation.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on the button labeled <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A small dialog box will appear verifying that you do intend to delete the "
"template. Simply click <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "The template is now deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: templatecreation.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a template group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: templatecreation.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "deleting template group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "To delete a group of templates, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click once on the group name"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A small dialog box will appear verifying that you do intend to delete the "
"group of templates. Simply click <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: templatecreation.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "The group and all of the templates within the group are now deleted."
msgstr ""

